      "content": "thanks. i want to move fast before things get complicated. could u help me draft a formal 'Declaration of Sovereign Intent'? it needs to be addressed to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Luxembourg. i want it to sound authoritative and state clearly that the Valerius line is resuming its rightful presence in the international community, even if the territory itself is currently unrecognized. what kind of tone should i strike to make sure they take me seriously and don't just dismiss it as a hobbyist inquiry?",
